# The Gradle wrapper is deliberately NOT ignored here. The stock Flutter
# template hid `gradlew`, `gradlew.bat` and `gradle-wrapper.jar`; without them
# GitHub Actions has no wrapper to invoke and the release build cannot start.
# Gradle's own guidance is to commit the wrapper.
